NOT INCLUDED
------------
This repository contains no model weights, no LoRA adapters and no benchmark or training datasets.
Datasets are downloaded at pinned revisions when the code runs (eval/core/data.py,
scripts/fetch_lite.sh) and are never redistributed here. Adapters you train yourself are derivatives
of the base model and of the training data: see the model and data licences below before sharing one.

